aving for fresh fruit try not to think  about the time she scooped out the eyes  from the sockets of quentin and pimby  it's bad enough that she extracts these  from her two victims while they're still  alive but she took him a step further  thanks to one of her concoctions cecily  and quentin are completely immobilized  during this impromptu surgery they can  still feel every agonizing moment while  myrtle revels and her revenge we could  spend hours dissecting the brutal  moments throughout ahs coven that make  us want to reconsider ever attending a  dinner party involving cocktails with  garnishes but there is only one that  will haunt us until the end of our days  in keeping with many fans criticisms of  coven that have popped up in  retrospectives of american horror story  several redditors pointed to the opening  scene of the season premiere as being  particularly difficult to watch although  we would say that's putting it mildly  the episode opens with real life serial  killer madame delphine lalorie hosting a  party in new orleans where she is  punishing one of her daughters for  trying to seduce a black horseman in  truly sadistic fashion he is the one who  bears the brunt of the punishment what  follows is one of the most horrifying  sequences in the history of ahs  transcending the horror genre and  hitting even closer to home than today's  cultural climate the sadistic socialite  brings demand bastion to the addict  where it's revealed that she keeps many  others in a makeshift torture chamber  delphine cruelly mocks her abused  captives calling them her pets as they  watch in horror while bastian's head is  covered by a hollowed-out bull's head he  whimpers while she says he's to become a  beast since he acted like one citing her  inspiration as the mythological greek  minotaur the head is then bonded to his  body completing the transformation fans  agreed that the brutal grotesque scene  went too far with users claiming they  almost gave up on the rest